{"id": "05", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[quickly] Okay! You guys... stay here! Practice jumping! [pause] I'll be in the arena!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "You ran to the Battle Arena, where nobody could embarrass you. [pause] But Mom followed you."}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[calm] Don't mind me, sweetie. I'm just watching."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Then someone hit Mom with a sword. [pause] And Mom... hit back."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[stunned] Mom... how did you DO that?"}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[modest] Oh. Muscle memory."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "That's when you learned the truth. [pause] In nineteen ninety-eight, your mom was the arcade champion of the whole state."}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[laughing softly] They called me \"The Queen.\" [pause] I retired. For you."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Ten minutes later... she was number one on the leaderboard."}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[sweetly] Nice try, honey! [pause] Sit up straight! [pause] Did you eat breakfast?"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "She defeated a hundred players. [pause] And she made sure every single one of them was hydrated."}, {"speaker": "DARKBLADE", "text": "[angry] One on one, Mom! [pause] Right now!"}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[sweetly] Okay, sweetie."}, {"speaker": "MOM", "text": "[kind] Good game! [pause] Don't forget to stretch!"}, {"speaker": "NOODLE", "text": "[screaming] YOUR MOM IS A LEGEND!"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[quietly] ...I'm the legend."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 4.4, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 86, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 4.4, "end_time_seconds": 10.16, "character_start_index": 86, "character_end_index": 178, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX", "start_time_seconds": 10.16, "end_time_